{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文台預測，本港地區今晚（17日）及明日重陽節（18日）大致多雲。</p><p>明早有一兩陣微雨，最低氣溫約27°C。</p><p>日間部分時間有陽光及乾燥，最高氣溫約31°C。</p><p>吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>展望隨後兩三日天晴乾燥。</p><p>下周三（21日）日間酷熱。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T10:59:34.573874+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T13:17:35.056711+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T10:57:39.517868+00:00","content_hash":"fb110fe6feb77672a6238fad86efc2ffe5a14b88586617cb276767b5b8a9c91b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}